### Case: valid-key — the app's own key, in X-Api-Key.
### Expect 200. With postman-echo.com as the upstream, the body lists the headers
### the backend received: x-supplier-key with the configured value, and no
### x-api-key. The response headers carry X-Request-Id and no supplier key.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/forecast?city=London
X-Api-Key: {{APP_API_KEY}}
accept: application/json
